# L2 packaging (C6) — keep the image small, and keep session/secret state OUT of every layer.

# Dependency / VCS / editor cruft — reinstalled by `npm ci` inside the build, never copied in.
node_modules/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.vscode/
*.log

# Tests, docs, and repo-hygiene files with no runtime purpose in the image.
tests/
test/
gateway/tests/
docs/
*.test.mjs
README.md
RESUME-PROMPT.md
OWNERSHIP.md
.npmignore
.npmrc.publish

# Orchestrator/session state — NEVER bake secrets, run history, or machine-local DBs into an
# image. `.ai/memory`, `.ai/contracts`, `.ai/cards` are durable orchestrator bookkeeping with no
# runtime purpose in a tenant container either; a tenant supplies its OWN `.ai/` at runtime via a
# mounted volume (see docker-compose.yml + docs/DEPLOY.md).
.ai/
.mos-worktrees/

# Local dev artifacts.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.env
.env.*
